Set is the collection of the unordered items.
Each elements in the set must be unique and immutable


Example:
nums = {1,2,3,4,5,6}
set2 = {1,2,2,2,2,2}
-----

We can store immutable variables in a set as they as they immutable as well.

For example: You can store the following things in a set
int
float
tuple
string
boolean

----XXXXXX
Lists and dictionary cannot be stored in a set as they are mutable.

